<BaseLayout title="Accessibility Statement | Hoffman Family Orthodontics" description="Hoffman Family Orthodontics is committed to making its website accessible. Contact our team for help accessing information or services.">
  <main id="main" class="interior-page"><div class="container policy-layout"><div class="policy-heading"><p class="section-kicker">Website information</p><h1>Accessibility <br>statement.</h1></div><article class="policy-copy">
    <p>Hoffman Family Orthodontics is committed to facilitating the accessibility and usability of its website, hoffmanfamilyorthodontics.com, for everyone. Hoffman Family Orthodontics aims to comply with all applicable standards, including the World Wide Web Consortium’s Web Content Accessibility Guidelines 2.0 up to Level AA (WCAG 2.0 AA).</p>
    <p>Hoffman Family Orthodontics is proud of the efforts that we have completed and that are in progress to ensure that our website is accessible to everyone.</p>
    <h2>If you need assistance</h2><p>Should you experience any difficulty in accessing any part of this website, please call us at <a href="tel:+19016250202">901.625.0202</a> or email us at <a href="mailto:info@hoffmanfamilyorthodontics.com">info@hoffmanfamilyorthodontics.com</a>. We will work with you to provide the information or service you seek through an alternate communication method that is accessible for you consistent with applicable law, for example through telephone support.</p>
  </article></div></main>
</BaseLayout>
